OL,3,GNEWSAYoung adults in the North 'dying
OL,4,Aat higher rates'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department of Health and Social
OL,7,FCare said it was determined to reduce
OL,8,Fhealth inequalities and close the
OL,9,Fdivide.
